 unassigned node, traverse sorted CSR neighbors, assign up to ceil(n/32), restart at smallest unassigned when frontier empties, discard frontier between clusters. Independent cluster p=.5. Isolate neighbor means=0. Not claimed optimal clustering.\",\n  \"controls\": \"constant y=3.25 on SBM M2, nonidentity reversal of all SBM M2 rows and edges, reset replay first scientific episode; within-plane reuse is intentional. Tolerances atol=rtol=1e-6.\",\n  \"rows\": 3095842,\n  \"graph_fingerprints\": 73,\n  \"split_audit\": {\n    \"normalized_graph_intersections\": 0,\n    \"normalized_raw_example_intersections\": 0,\n    \"checked_before_fitting\": true,\n    \"source_seed_sets_disjoint\": true,\n    \"different_id_duplicate_test\": \"rejected\",\n    \"node_relabel_duplicate_test\": \"rejected\",\n    \"audit_scope\": \"complete production graphs and all six raw experimental mechanisms; matched within-plane controls intentionally reuse input\"\n  },\n  \"preflight\": {\n    \"rpc_operation_counts\": {\n      \"reset\": 625,\n      \"ingest\": 5000,\n      \"fit\": 625,\n      \"predict\": 625\n    },\n    \"rpc_total\": 6875,\n    \"max_request_utf8_json_envelope_and_framing_bytes\": 5592859,\n    \"max_prediction_utf8_json_envelope_and_framing_bytes\": 384099,\n    \"chunk_decoded_bytes\": 4194304,\n    \"max_logical_input_decoded_bytes\": 33554432,\n    \"largest_shape_actual_input_decoded_bytes\": 5676000,\n    \"max_prediction_decoded_bytes\": 288000,\n    \"wire_limit_bytes_exclusive\": 67108864,\n    \"framing_model\": \"full JSON line including base64 metadata inside request/response id envelope plus eight framing bytes; runtime messages additionally bounded\",\n    \"mock_max_chunk_trace_verified\": true,\n    \"scheduler_scenarios\": [\n      \"near_limit\",\n      \"mid_timeout\",\n      \"reset_timeout\",\n      \"slow_cleanup\"\n    ],\n    \"largest_shape_native_validation\": {\n      \"n\": 12000,\n      \"m\": 600000,\n      \"p\": 8,\n      \"rpc_calls\